msgstr "正在檢查…"

msgid "Installed version: "
msgstr "已安裝版本: "

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

msgid "Spaces a tab renders as. Applies to files opened after the change."
msgstr "定位字元顯示的空格數。適用於變更後開啟的檔案。"

msgid "Which IDE's default shortcuts to use for the commands this editor supports."
msgstr "此編輯器支援的命令使用哪個 IDE 的預設快速鍵。"

msgid "Also: Ctrl+MouseWheel, Ctrl+'+'/'-', Ctrl+0 resets."
msgstr "另外:Ctrl+滑鼠滾輪、Ctrl+'+'/'-',Ctrl+0 重設。"

msgid "When ATE is the External Script Editor, non-text requests (solutions, binaries, project sync) are forwarded here."
msgstr "當 ATE 是外部指令碼編輯器時,非文字請求(解決方案、二進位檔、專案同步)將轉發至此。"

msgid "Compiler-accurate colors and Go to Definition. If the project has no Roslyn, enabling installs the bundled MIT-licensed Roslyn assemblies (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES)."
msgstr "編譯器級準確的顏色和移至定義。如果專案沒有 Roslyn,啟用時將安裝隨附的 MIT 授權 Roslyn 組件(參見 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES)。"

msgid "Animate wheel scrolling instead of stepping line by line."
msgstr "滾輪捲動使用動畫而非逐行跳動。"

msgid "Default view when opening .md files: rendered (WYSIWYG) when on, source when off. The MD/source toggle still switches per tab."
msgstr "開啟 .md 檔案時的預設檢視:開啟時為轉譯(所見即所得),關閉時為原始碼。MD/原始碼切換仍可按分頁切換。"

msgid "How many entries File → Recent Files keeps (1-30)."
msgstr "檔案 → 最近的檔案保留的項目數(1-30)。"

msgid "Check GitHub for new releases and offer to install them."
msgstr "在 GitHub 上檢查新版本並提示安裝。"

msgid "Days between automatic update checks. 1 = daily; never more often than once per day."
msgstr "自動更新檢查的間隔天數。1 = 每天;每天最多檢查一次。"

msgid "No file open.\nFile → New, File → Open…, or right-click a text asset in the Project window."
msgstr "沒有開啟的檔案。\n檔案 → 新增、檔案 → 開啟…,或在 Project 視窗中右鍵點擊文字資源。"

msgid "Updating ADKOM Text Editor…\nPlease wait — the editor will reload when the update completes."
msgstr "正在更新 ADKOM Text Editor…\n請稍候 — 更新完成後編輯器將重新載入。"

msgid "(unknown version)"
msgstr "(未知版本)"

msgid "A real code editor, living right inside the Unity Editor."
msgstr "一個真正的程式碼編輯器,就在 Unity 編輯器內。"

msgid "100% Editor-only — nothing ships in player builds."
msgstr "100% 僅限編輯器 — 玩家建置中不包含任何內容。"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "確定"

msgid "Go to Definition needs Semantic Features, which are currently disabled.\n\nEnable them now? The semantics module — and, if your project has no Roslyn, the bundled MIT-licensed Roslyn assemblies — will be installed automatically."
msgstr "移至定義需要語意功能,目前已停用。\n\n現在啟用嗎?語意模組(如果專案沒有 Roslyn,還有隨附的 MIT 授權 Roslyn 組件)將自動安裝。"

msgid "Enable and Install"
msgstr "啟用並安裝"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Semantic features are still installing or compiling — try again in a moment."
msgstr "語意功能仍在安裝或編譯中 — 請稍後重試。"

msgid "Resolving symbol…"
msgstr "正在解析符號…"

msgid "Defined in "
msgstr "定義於 "

msgid "Definition not found."
msgstr "找不到定義。"

msgid "Go to Definition failed: "
msgstr "移至定義失敗: "

msgid "Recent file no longer exists: "
msgstr "最近的檔案已不存在: "

msgid "Kept buffer of deleted file {0} — Save to restore it to disk."
msgstr "已保留被刪除檔案 {0} 的緩衝區 — 儲存即可將其還原到磁碟。"

msgid "Reloaded {0} from disk."
msgstr "已從磁碟重新載入 {0}。"

msgid "Kept in-editor version of {0}."
msgstr "已保留 {0} 的編輯器內版本。"

msgid "No file open"
msgstr "沒有開啟的檔案"

msgid "'{0}' was deleted from disk. Keep the buffer (Save can bring the file back), or close the tab?"
msgstr "'{0}' 已從磁碟刪除。保留緩衝區(儲存可還原檔案),還是關閉分頁?"

msgid "'{0}' was modified outside the editor. Reload it? (unsaved changes here would be lost)"
msgstr "'{0}' 已在編輯器外部被修改。重新載入嗎?(此處未儲存的變更將遺失)"

msgid "'{0}' has unsaved changes."
msgstr "'{0}' 有未儲存的變更。"

msgid "{0} tabs have unsaved changes."
msgstr "{0} 個分頁有未儲存的變更。"

msgid "Keep Buffer"
msgstr "保留緩衝區"

msgid "Reload"
msgstr "重新載入"

msgid "Keep Mine"
msgstr "保留我的版本"

msgid "Discard"
msgstr "放棄"

msgid "Discard All"
msgstr "全部放棄"

